#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/0-index.md:1
#: c876f2d9a13349308822311ae70e70a3
msgid "Simulation"
msgstr "仿真"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/0-index.md:3
#: da4035665a1d43b7a5ee55926bf58060
msgid ""
"The default physics simulation path is NVIDIA Isaac Sim (FaSim). Start "
"Isaac and run the first checks: [Isaac Sim](4-isaac_sim.md). To view and "
"control the robot in a browser while Sim is running, start Viser first: "
"[Start Viser](../3-programming/5-python_interface.md#start-viser). "
"Mechanisms, extensions, and USD layout: [Simulation "
"reference](../../4-reference/simulation/0-index.md)."
msgstr "默认的物理仿真路径是 NVIDIA Isaac Sim（FaSim）。启动 Isaac 并做第一次检查：[Isaac Sim](4-isaac_sim.md)。仿真运行时若要在浏览器里查看并控制机器人，先启动 Viser：[启动 Viser](../3-programming/5-python_interface.md#start-viser)。机制、扩展和 USD 布局：[仿真参考](../../4-reference/simulation/0-index.md)。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/0-index.md:5
#: 927de6ea948546c3be2bcbee41c8b594
msgid ""
"`hardware:=mock_components` / `gz` / `isaac` are launch keys, not vendor "
"hardware-interface packages under `hardwares/`. `isaac_sim` is set inside"
" Isaac on the in-process path; it is not a `demo.launch.py` flag. Plugin "
"table: [ros2_control in This "
"Stack](../../3-concepts/1-ros2_control_here.md). Isaac topic `<param>` "
"names: "
"[topic_based_ros2_control](../../4-reference/hardware/1-topic_based.md)."
msgstr "`hardware:=mock_components` / `gz` / `isaac` 是 launch 键，不是 `hardwares/` 下的厂商驱动层包。`isaac_sim` 是在进程内路径上、由 Isaac 内部设置的，不是 `demo.launch.py` 的参数。插件表：[本栈中的 ros2_control](../../3-concepts/1-ros2_control_here.md)。Isaac 话题 `<param>` 名称：[topic_based_ros2_control](../../4-reference/hardware/1-topic_based.md)。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/0-index.md:7
#: 88a4e2c74efa4cbe9361882830e5b712
msgid "Gazebo remains available as an alternative backend: [Gazebo Simulation](3-gazebo_sim.md)."
msgstr "Gazebo 仍可作为备选后端使用：[Gazebo 仿真](3-gazebo_sim.md)。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/2-simulation/0-index.md:9
#: 3dc5a6e05fa5443c85a698909f61b61a
msgid ""
"Isaac USD → composer → LeRobot datagen is the [Synthetic "
"Data](../7-synthetic_data/0-index.md) How-To category, not Gazebo."
msgstr ""
"Isaac USD → composer → LeRobot "
"数据采集属于[合成数据](../7-synthetic_data/0-index.md)操作指南大类，不是 Gazebo。"

